  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Spirit Affinity House’s first supreme elder tells him to protect the sect’s fairy on the Northern Plains journey because she is only a false immortal whose ascension was recent. He is a supreme elder of Spirit Affinity House and a rank seven phantom path Gu Immortal, and he vows that as long as he is alive he will ensure her safety, then cups his fists and takes Zhao Lian Yun away on a ruin bat.",
      "chapters": [
        1237
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spirit_affinity_first_supreme_elder",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_zhao_lian_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He follows Zhao Lian Yun and says their group is too powerful, with three rank eight Gu Immortals and three Immortal Gu Houses, so victory is basically assured. Watching Wind Sweeping Building move through a tunnel in the heavenly wind qi wall, he is tongue-tied that the wall is thicker than the five regional walls and that the heavenly winds already make them unstable.",
      "chapters": [
        1239
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-wind-crossing",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_wind_sweeping_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Trapped in Hair Mistress’s blue hair cocoons on Snowy Mountain blessed land’s ninth peak, he turns phantom to pass through his own cocoon, then does the same for Zhao Lian Yun and the other three, an ability to turn others into phantom that is unusual even for a phantom path cultivator. Phantom path Gu Immortals are very few in number, and he is no doubt an exceptional talent even among them.",
      "chapters": [
        1251
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "turning-others-phantom",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hair_mistress",
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "path_phantom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After love Gu’s radiance moves the group among Snowy Mountain peaks, a black hole drags him in despite rank seven strength. Facing a shadow attack he uses turn phantom, his specialty as a phantom path Gu Immortal, and the shadow passes through him.",
      "chapters": [
        1254
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-specialty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_love_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the seventh peak of Snowy Mountain blessed land he recognizes Shadow King and answers that it is not certain who dies yet when Shadow King says Central Continent Gu Immortals came running into death. Shadow King turns into a pitch-black shadow and pounces on him as muffled explosions shake the hall and snow rolls down the peak.",
      "chapters": [
        1255
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-king-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Watching Fang Yuan, fighting at Reverse Flow River under the Northern Plains name Liu Guan Yi, reflect the immemorial desolate beast Mao Li Qiu’s attack back and leave its paw bloodied while taking no injury himself, he mutters the pairing “Central’s Feng Jiu Ge, North’s Liu Guan Yi” in a daze.",
      "chapters": [
        1289
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pairing-with-feng-jiu-ge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_reverse_flow_river",
        "char_mao_li_qiu",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    }
  ],
